#24:Configure IC11 for temp and read AIN4 TH3 MSB & LSB for temperature:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x22 0x08 0x05 0x00}  
SUB: READ_SENSOR
//Checks . . . MSB = %RS_MSB%, LSB = %RS_LSB% and decimal result = %RESULT%
-------------------------------------
Voltage = [3.3 * %RESULT% / (16 * 4095)]V
-------------------------------------
